F3 — ACCESSIBILITY.md #7 and #12 / WCAG 2.2 1.4.11, web/static/js/whatif-spending-optimizer.js:226-236,253-254. Real Plotly `.gridlayer path` strokes measure 1.49:1 (`#d6d3d1` on white) in light and 1.99:1 (`#57534e` on gray-800) in dark, below the constitution's explicit 3:1 chart-stroke floor. Data strokes pass (sampled minimum 6.70:1 light, 8.41:1 dark).

